---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Studio Ravya"
  description="Studio Ravya privacy policy covering client inquiry data collection, confidentiality, and data protection practices."
>
  <div class="max-w-[820px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-primary block mb-2">Legal &amp; Trust</span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-on-surface font-normal mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-outline font-mono">Last updated: March 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed space-y-8">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-on-surface font-normal">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          Studio Ravya ("we", "our", or "the Studio") collects information you provide voluntarily when submitting scoping inquiries or contacting us directly. This includes your name, work email, company name, project goals, estimated budget range, and desired timeline.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-on-surface font-normal">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>
          Your information is used strictly to evaluate your project request, prepare accurate proposals, communicate during active project sprints, and respond to your direct correspondence. We do not sell, license, or rent your contact details to third-party marketing brokers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-on-surface font-normal">3. Confidentiality &amp; NDAs</h2>
        <p>
          We treat all client business concepts, intellectual property, unreleased technology, and commercial metrics with strict confidentiality. A bilateral Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) is available upon request prior to discovery calls.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-on-surface font-normal">4. Analytics &amp; Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          Our site uses privacy-conscious, lightweight analytics to monitor aggregate performance and page load metrics. We do not track visitors across external web properties.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-on-surface font-normal">5. Contact Regarding Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this policy or wish to request data deletion, email our team directly at <a href="mailto:contact@studioravya.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">contact@studioravya.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
